WEBVTT

00:09:28.563 --> 00:09:34.697
or they see a potential for that artist
to play a significant part in history.

00:09:36.497 --> 00:09:40.130
Once purchased directly from the artist,

00:09:40.163 --> 00:09:43.030
you store your NFTs
in your digital wallet.

00:09:43.063 --> 00:09:44.263
From there,

00:09:44.263 --> 00:09:48.563
you can show on screens
and online marketplaces,

00:09:48.597 --> 00:09:51.363
or in galleries, such as RareRooms,

00:09:51.363 --> 00:09:54.797
a blockchain innovation
by Atlanta's GigLabs.

00:09:54.797 --> 00:09:58.863
And with NFTs, a buyer knows
their art is fair trade,

00:09:58.863 --> 00:10:00.563
transactions are transparent,